// ptr_off2's element size, split out because type_size(elem_ty(ex_ty(a)))
// is two levels of nested call and ptr_off2 has no room left once the
// address text is counted.
ptr_off2_sz(int a) {
  int ty = ex_ty(a);
  int ety = elem_ty(ty);
  int sz = type_size(ety);
} return int sz;
given txt_fixture (0):(4) then calls ex_ty:(0)
given txt_fixture (5):(4) then calls ex_ty:(5)
